        "content": "## Blog Agent 2: Researcher v3\n\n**Trigger:** Every 10 min\n**Input:** blog_pipeline (status = idea_generated)\n**Output:** Exa research brief → status = research_complete\n\n**Model:** Exa AI /search (5 results, with summaries)\n**Cost:** ~$0.011/call (neural search + per-article LLM summaries)\n**Quality:** Real sourced articles — not hallucinated stats\n\n**v3 Changes:**\n- Replaced Perplexity (expired API key) with Exa AI\n- Auth header: x-api-key (not Authorization: Bearer)\n- Response path: results[].summary (was choices[0].message.content)\n- research_brief = 5 article summaries joined with --- separators",
